    /* On narrow screens the illustration sits behind the copy rather than
       beside it, so the fade runs vertically instead of horizontally.

       The layer is pinned to the illustration's own box (asset1.webp is
       1916x821, so at full width it occupies 100/2.334 = 42.9vw) rather than
       to the full hero. Masking the hero height instead would spread the
